  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HSBC is funding BRC&apos;s work as part of the wider DEC Gaza and ME Emergency Appeal campaign.&#xA0;&#xA0;
Funding split: The funding allocation they are seeking to support, which is agreeable to International Ops, is (excluding CTC and monitoring costs): Lebanon &#x2013; 50%, OPT &#x2013; 40%, Israel &#x2013; 10%.&#xA0; 
Geographic restrictions: Restricted to the response in Israel, OPT and the Lebanon and excluding support for Syria (due to the sanctions applied to Syria).</narrative>
